      "question": "<p>Given that</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\log_2(x+3)+\\log_2(x+10)=2+2\\log_2x\" data-display=\"true\"></div><ol class=\"parts\"><li>show that<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3x^2-13x-30=0\" data-display=\"true\"></div><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li><li><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"i\"><li>Write down the roots of the equation<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3x^2-13x-30=0\" data-display=\"true\"></div></li><li>Hence state which of the roots in part (b)(i) is not a solution of<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\log_2(x+3)+\\log_2(x+10)=2+2\\log_2x\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>giving a reason for your answer.</p></li></ol><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li></ol>",
