      "question": "<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(x)=\\frac{3kx-18}{(x+4)(x-2)}\\qquad\\text{where }k\\text{ is a positive constant}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><ol class=\"parts\"><li>Express <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(x)\"></span> in partial fractions in terms of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span>. <span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li><li>Hence find the exact value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span> for which<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\int_{-3}^{1}\\mathrm f(x)\\,\\mathrm dx=21\" data-display=\"true\"></div><span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></li></ol>",
